			<item>
				<title></title>
				<link>http://localhost:61517/about/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:61517/about/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hi, my name is Cam.&lt;/strong&gt; I&amp;rsquo;m a data journalist and investigative reporter based out of the greatest city in the world, Chicago. You can usually find me trekking around the Midwest for business and pleasure.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;📰 &lt;strong&gt;Right now&lt;/strong&gt;, I&amp;rsquo;m a &lt;strong&gt;data reporter&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong&gt;Chicago Public Media&lt;/strong&gt;, which publishes the &lt;strong&gt;Chicago Sun-Times&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;WBEZ&lt;/strong&gt;, Chicago&amp;rsquo;s NPR station. I cover everything under the sun that impacts people in and around Chicago, on air, on the web and in print. Some recent stories of mine include looking at the &lt;a href=&#34;https://chicago.suntimes.com/weather/2026/06/16/chicago-severe-weather-complaints-311-calls-record-breaking-amount-downed-trees&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;record number of 311 calls related to severe weather in Chicago&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.wbez.org/housing/2026/06/05/barack-obama-airbnb-presidential-center-chicago-affordable-housing&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;increase of short-term rentals in the neighborhoods around the Obama Presidential Center&lt;/a&gt;. If you have ideas for a story, or something you want me to take a look at, you can reach me at &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:crodriguez@wbez.org&#34;&gt;crodriguez@wbez.org&lt;/a&gt;. 💌&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
