				<title></title>
				<link>http://localhost:61517/resume/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:61517/resume/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This page is a work in progress, but these are the big ones!&lt;/strong&gt; (Questions? &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:heycamrodriguez@gmail.com&#34;&gt;Email me!&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;work&#34;&gt;Work&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;dl&gt;&#xA;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;em&gt;Data Reporter&lt;/em&gt; — &lt;strong&gt;WBEZ Chicago&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;The Chicago Sun-Times&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;4/26 to present&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Member of the data and investigations team, covering everything under the sun that impacts people in and around Chicago, on air, on the web and in print.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://chicago.suntimes.com/weather/2026/06/16/chicago-severe-weather-complaints-311-calls-record-breaking-amount-downed-trees&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt; the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://chicago.suntimes.com/weather/2026/06/16/chicago-severe-weather-complaints-311-calls-record-breaking-amount-downed-trees&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;record number of 311 calls related to severe weather in Chicago&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.wbez.org/housing/2026/06/05/barack-obama-airbnb-presidential-center-chicago-affordable-housing&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt; the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.wbez.org/housing/2026/06/05/barack-obama-airbnb-presidential-center-chicago-affordable-housing&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;increase of short-term rentals in the neighborhoods around the Obama Presidential Center&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://chicago.suntimes.com/education/2026/07/29/latino-high-schools-hit-especially-hard-by-teacher-cuts-in-cps-budget-heading-for-vote&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt; the ways that &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://chicago.suntimes.com/education/2026/07/29/latino-high-schools-hit-especially-hard-by-teacher-cuts-in-cps-budget-heading-for-vote&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Latino schools were impacted the most by district budget cuts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://chicago.suntimes.com/weather/2026/07/01/workers-brave-extreme-temperatures-as-heat-wave-stretches-on-in-chicago&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt; how &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://chicago.suntimes.com/weather/2026/07/01/workers-brave-extreme-temperatures-as-heat-wave-stretches-on-in-chicago&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;extreme heat is causing fatal outcomes across the Chicago area&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;/dl&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;dl&gt;&#xA;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;em&gt;Local Investigations Fellow&lt;/em&gt; — &lt;strong&gt;The New York Times&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;9/24 to 12/25&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;One of ten fellows in the 2024-2025 Local Investigations Fellowship cohort, covering the spread of warehouses across Illinois and the very real human impacts of next-day delivery.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
